WEBVTT

00:00:01.658 --> 00:00:03.117
Sonorus!

00:00:04.369 --> 00:00:06.496
[MUSIC STOPS]

00:00:07.372 --> 00:00:12.669
Earlier today, Professor Moody placed
the Triwizard Cup deep within the maze.

00:00:12.752 --> 00:00:17.757
Only he knows its exact position.
Now, as Mr. Diggory...

00:00:18.007 --> 00:00:19.676
[CHEERING]

00:00:19.884 --> 00:00:21.678
...and Mr. Potter...

00:00:21.886 --> 00:00:23.388
[CHEERING]

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:25.390
...are tied for first position...

00:00:25.598 --> 00:00:27.600
...they will be the first to
enter the maze,

00:00:27.684 --> 00:00:29.352
followed by Mr. Krum...

00:00:29.519 --> 00:00:30.687
[CHEERING]

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:34.399
-...and Miss Delacour.
-Come on! Krum! Krum! Krum!

00:00:35.275 --> 00:00:38.361
DUMBLEDORE: The first person
to touch the cup will be the winner!

00:00:42.699 --> 00:00:45.410
I've instructed the staff
to patrol the perimeter.

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:48.538
Should, at any point, a contestant wish
to withdraw from the task...

00:00:48.705 --> 00:00:53.167
...he or she need only send up
red sparks with their wands.

00:00:53.543 --> 00:00:57.422
Contestants! Gather around. Quickly!

00:01:00.633 --> 00:01:04.804
In the maze, you'll find no dragons
or creatures of the deep.

00:01:05.013 --> 00:01:08.433
Instead, you'll face something
even more challenging.

00:01:08.683 --> 00:01:11.644
You see, people change in the maze.

00:01:11.728 --> 00:01:13.563
Oh, find the cup if you can.

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:18.443
But be very wary, you could just
lose yourselves along the way.

00:01:19.819 --> 00:01:22.822
Champions, prepare yourselves!

00:01:31.831 --> 00:01:33.458
Good luck.

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:35.752
-My boy.
-See you later, Dad.

00:01:38.087 --> 00:01:40.757
On the count of three. One--

00:01:42.759 --> 00:01:44.761
[MARCHING BAND PLAYING]

00:03:16.185 --> 00:03:17.854
[CRASHING]

00:03:17.937 --> 00:03:20.064
[PANTING]

00:03:38.458 --> 00:03:40.710
[RUSTLING]

00:03:48.885 --> 00:03:50.887
[PANTING]

00:04:06.819 --> 00:04:07.904
[HISSING]

00:04:07.987 --> 00:04:09.906
[SCREAMS]

00:04:14.911 --> 00:04:16.829
[CREAKING]

00:05:08.506 --> 00:05:09.799
Fleur?

00:05:11.384 --> 00:05:12.927
Fleur.

00:05:16.389 --> 00:05:18.182
Periculum!

00:05:27.441 --> 00:05:29.986
[WIND HOWLING]

00:05:46.085 --> 00:05:49.213
[VOICES WHISPERING]

00:05:55.011 --> 00:05:56.721
[KRUM SHOUTS INDISTINCTLY]

00:05:56.971 --> 00:05:58.347
CEDRIC:
Get down!

00:05:59.015 --> 00:06:00.725
Get down!

00:06:01.225 --> 00:06:02.560
Expelliarmus!

00:06:06.022 --> 00:06:08.024
[GRUNTS]

00:06:12.069 --> 00:06:15.323
No, don't! Stop!
He's bewitched, Cedric!

00:06:15.489 --> 00:06:17.575
-Get off me!
-He's bewitched!

00:06:24.749 --> 00:06:26.125
[SHIRT RIPS]
[GRUNTS]

00:06:29.128 --> 00:06:31.005
HARRY:
Yes.

00:06:33.341 --> 00:06:35.885
[GRUNTING]

00:06:40.765 --> 00:06:42.475
[YELLS]

00:06:51.776 --> 00:06:53.527
Harry!

00:06:55.988 --> 00:06:57.531
Harry!

00:06:59.992 --> 00:07:01.285
Harry!

00:07:03.788 --> 00:07:05.289
Harry!

00:07:07.291 --> 00:07:09.085
Reducto!

00:07:19.553 --> 00:07:21.305
[PANTING]

00:07:21.514 --> 00:07:23.307
[COUGHING]

00:07:24.809 --> 00:07:28.396
-Th-- Thanks.
-No problem.

00:07:28.813 --> 00:07:33.526
You know, for a moment there,
I thought you were gonna let it get me.

00:07:33.693 --> 00:07:35.403
For a moment, so did I.

00:07:37.196 --> 00:07:38.447
Some game, huh?

00:07:39.448 --> 00:07:40.950
Some game.

00:07:41.117 --> 00:07:43.119
[BRANCHES POPPING AND CRACKING]

00:07:43.661 --> 00:07:45.788
[WIND HOWLING]

00:07:46.205 --> 00:07:48.082
Go!

00:07:58.134 --> 00:08:01.137
Go on, take it.
You saved me, take it!

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:03.222
-Together. One, two...
-Two...

00:08:03.472 --> 00:08:04.724
-...three!
-...three!

00:08:07.852 --> 00:08:10.104
[GRUNTING]

00:08:17.153 --> 00:08:20.156
-You okay?
-Yeah. You?

00:08:27.163 --> 00:08:28.497
Where are we?

00:08:29.373 --> 00:08:31.500
[CROW CAWS]

00:08:34.170 --> 00:08:35.880
I've been here before.

00:08:39.467 --> 00:08:41.177
It's a Portkey.

00:08:43.012 --> 00:08:47.183
-Harry, the cup is a Portkey.
-I've been here before, in a dream.

00:08:49.185 --> 00:08:52.605
Cedric! We have to get back
to the cup. Now!

00:08:52.772 --> 00:08:54.648
What are you talking about?

00:08:54.857 --> 00:08:55.900
[DOOR CREAKING OPEN]

00:08:57.026 --> 00:08:58.110
[HARRY YELLS]

00:08:58.194 --> 00:08:59.779
[GRUNTING]
